{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "raw-isotopes/1",
  "title": "raw-isotopes/1: do M+1 and M+2 fit this formula, within counting error? `mzlab-cli raw isotopes`",
  "description": "Per file the net ion counts of the bins M, M+1 and M+2 over the peak region of M (the sides subtracted), the observed ratios R1 = N1/N0 and R2 = N2/N0 with their delta-method sigma, and with `--formula` the expected pattern of `ion pattern` with a z score and a verdict per ratio (consistent, inconsistent, undetermined with its reason); without a formula the carbon range from R1 and the M+2 hint, as evidence only. `interference` holds the correlation of M+1 and M+2 with M over the region. Every key of a result is present; a value that does not apply is null. An `inconsistent` or `undetermined` verdict is an answer: exit 0. Code: crates/mzlab-core/src/rawiso.rs, crates/mzlab-cli/src/raw_iso_cmd.rs.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "query",
    "files",
    "results",
    "warnings",
    "provenance"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "const": "raw-isotopes/1"
    },
    "query": {
      "type": "object"
    },
    "files": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "file",
              "container",
              "sha256",
              "size_bytes",
              "samples"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "file": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "container": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "sha256": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
              },
              "size_bytes": {
                "type": [
                  "integer",
                  "null"
                ]
              },
              "samples": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "id",
                    "name",
                    "ms_level",
                    "n_level_scans",
                    "ion_quantum",
                    "counts",
                    "mz_offset",
                    "thresholds"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": [
                        "integer",
                        "null"
                      ]
                    },
                    "name": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "ms_level": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
